// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// This App demonstrates the level of complexity SimpleSal supports: more than loop, less than RTOS.
// SimpleSal's Time and Event API helps solve complex problems a looping baremetal algorithm can't.
// The solutions are simplified versions of RTOS or OS algorithms: Time- and Event-based software.
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// This minimum App demonstrates software in a legacy App interacting with ssTEA and ssUI real-time.
// The App's (forced) design: App's loop emits signals causing ssTEA to grant the Time Event Agency.
// The legacy code turns the BuiltIn LED On every second, ignoring the state it is in at the time.
// The demonstration of ssTEA includes a Time Event to turn the LED Off at some later point in Time,
// and a Data Event to display data generated by the Time Event.  The key word is demonstration.
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
